section__
  @title "Qarth Alliance Split near the godswood"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/06-endgame-allegiances/frame-391.jpg"

  "In the godswood outside Qarth's trading enclave, cedar smoke from foreign braziers cuts through the smell of thawing earth. Davos brings contracts from neutral merchants who want immunity before they finance anyone. Robb brings names of northern houses ready to quit your coalition if those same merchants gain protected status.

This split is the price of surviving too long. Everyone agrees you are useful; no one agrees what you should be allowed to become. A public settlement can force both camps to accept one framework and reveal who refuses lawful constraint. A hidden settlement can buy temporary cohesion by paying different prices to different factions, then praying the accounts never leak.

A raven startles from the weirwood and drops black feathers into the mud at your feet. Even silence feels like a vote now."

  choice__
    @target "The Wall War Map against old law"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Publish one alliance code for north and merchants alike, accepting immediate backlash to secure clear loyalties."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Run dual promises through back channels, preserving unity now while stockpiling blackmail for the fallout."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "The Wall War Map against old law"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/06-endgame-allegiances/frame-392.jpg"

  "The war map chamber at the Wall is colder than reason. Frost rims the table edges, and old vows are carved into the beams above your head. Tyrion argues that legitimacy wins the south. Varys argues that survivability wins everything. The Watch delegates do not care which theory prevails; they need men, glass, and grain before the first dead patrol comes back.

Desertions have climbed because no one believes the coalition can fight court war and northern war at once. If you answer publicly, you can force the realm to acknowledge the existential threat and commit visible resources. If you answer through covert pressure, you can strip rivals of influence and redirect supplies without another public fracture. A foreign acceleration route remains possible, but it will bind future sovereignty to outside creditors.

Your gloves stick briefly to the frozen map pins when you move them. The old law says the Wall protects the realm. Tonight, you decide whether the realm still protects the Wall."

  choice__
    @target "Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Issue a formal Wall compact before witnesses, compelling southern and northern houses to fund frontier defense."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 5)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Deploy intelligence files against obstructing lords, redirecting men and stores through deniable coercion."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
    @when ((wealth + essos_ties + dragon_factor) >= 9)
    @action wealth = clampStat(wealth - 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action dragon_factor = clampStat(dragon_factor + 1, 0, 30)
    "Purchase emergency escorts and supply caravans from Essosi brokers, trading treasury and autonomy for speed."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/06-endgame-allegiances/frame-393.jpg"

  "Castle Black's inheritance chamber is cut into ice-dark stone and lit by sputtering tallow that smells like burnt fat. The Watch envoys demand clarity on who controls abandoned keeps, supply tunnels, and levy rights now that half the old line commanders are dead. Varys watches the envoys. Tyrion watches you. Both are measuring whether House Valehart will govern by charter or by intimidation.

Every unanswered claim becomes a recruitment tool for rival banners. If you settle command succession in open record, you may lose room to maneuver but keep the northern coalition intact. If you settle it in secret with selected captains, you can enforce obedience fast and invite accusations of usurpation by moonrise. Men at the Wall obey certainty long before they trust kindness.

Frost climbs the iron hinges while ravens claw at the shutters. This decision decides who can issue lawful orders when the snows close the roads."

  choice__
    @target "Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 2, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Ratify a public command succession before the Watch and banner lords, accepting limits to keep legitimacy intact."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Oldtown Silent Betrayal behind closed doors"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
